                                "text": "Just riffing at this point: maybe you have a knowledge graph either from a tool like Obsidian or extracted from a source document. Then the tool associates facts with items from the outline. Or maybe the knowledge graph is used to constrain or weight the items in the outline.  It becomes a process of expanding and winnowing, guided by the user. In some respects, it's almost the opposite of the \"exploration\" use case demonstrated in your tool today."
